{29}{The reason that followers that have magick do not cast spells is that the A.I is very conservative with regards to fatigue. Do you want your followers to have more fatigue so that they can cast more spells ?}{The reason that followers that have magick do not cast spells is that the A.I is very conservative with regards to fatigue. Do you want your followers to have more fatigue so that they can cast more spells ?}{}{}{}{}
