{33}{The way the game works is that in combat  when you change sector ( 64 tiles square) your followers teleports close to you if they are far away. For finer combat control you want your followers to teleport when.}{The way the game works is that in combat  when you change sector ( 64 tiles square) your followers teleports close to you if they are far away. For finer combat control you want your followers to teleport when.}{}{}{}{}
