{37}{This version introduces death strike. Death strike effects 90% of monsters and undead. It is a chance to kill with 1 strike or spell.}{This version introduces death strike. Death strike effects 90% of monsters and undead. It is a chance to kill with 1 strike or spell.}{}{}{}{}
{38}{Please go on.}{}{1}{}{39}{}
{39}{The chance to do a death strike is constant. But you are only going to have a chance to do a death strike if you are the same level as the monster and your perception is maxed 20.For every point that your perception is lower than 20 you must be 2 levels higher than the monster.Death strike will work with direct area of effect spells.}{The chance to do a death strike is constant. But you are only going to have a chance to do a death strike if you are the same level as the monster and your perception is maxed 20.For every point that your perception is lower than 20 you must be 2 levels higher than the monster.Death strike will work with direct area of effect spells.}{}{}{}{}
