{83}{Just one thing more. I must inform you that encumbrance in the world of Arcanum not only reduces your speed but also your dodge skill and magickal aptitude. More specifically each level of encumbrance reduces your magickal aptitude by 10.You can however spend more points in spells to compensate.}{Just one thing more. I must inform you that encumbrance in the world of Arcanum not only reduces your speed but also your dodge skill and magickal aptitude. More specifically each level of encumbrance reduces your magickal aptitude by 10.You can however spend more points in spells to compensate.}{}{}{}{}
